  </table>
  <div style="margin-top: 20px; text-align: right;">
    <p>Yours Faithfully,</p>
    <strong>{{borrower.fullName}}</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="avoid-break" style="margin-top: 25px; border-top: 1px solid #aaa; padding-top: 15px;">
    <p class="section-title">Disbursement Acknowledgement Letter</p>
    <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{application.applicationDateFormatted}}</p>
    <p>I/We hereby confirm that we have received the Disbursement of an amount of <strong>Rs. {{formatCurrencyWithoutSymbol loan.netDisbursedAmount}}/- ({{words loan.netDisbursedAmount}} Only)</strong>, in respect of the loan/facility sanctioned by FFPL to me/us vide the Loan Agreement dated <strong>{{application.applicationDateFormatted}}</strong>.</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px; text-align: right;">
      <strong>Name: {{borrower.fullName}}</strong><br />
      Signature: ______________________
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <!-- 7. VERNACULAR & END USE UNDERTAKING                          -->
  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <div class="page-break"></div>
  <p class="section-title">DECLARATION FOR SIGNING IN VERNACULAR LANGUAGE</p>
  <p>This is to certify that I have read out the contents of the Loan Agreement being entered into with FFPL to Mr/Ms <strong>{{borrower.fullName}}</strong> (“Borrower”) and he/she has understood the same.</p>
  <p>यह प्रमाणित करने के लिए है कि मैंने FFPL के साथ किए जा रहे ऋण अनुबंध की सामग्री को श्री/श्रीमती <strong>{{borrower.fullName}}</strong> को पढ़कर सुनाया है और उसने इसे समझ लिया है।</p>
  <p>I confirm that the terms and conditions contained in the Loan Agreement have been explained to me and I have understood and agree to the terms and conditions mentioned in the Loan Agreement.</p>
  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <p><strong>Name of Borrower:</strong> {{borrower.fullName}}</p>
    <p><strong>Signature / Thumb Impression:</strong> ______________________</p>
    <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{application.applicationDateFormatted}}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="avoid-break" style="margin-top: 25px; border-top: 1px solid #aaa; padding-top: 15px;">
    <p class="section-title">END USE UNDERTAKING</p>
    <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{application.applicationDateFormatted}}</p>
    <p>To,<br /><strong>{{lender.legalName}}</strong></p>
    <p>In respect of the facility amounting to <strong>Rs. {{formatCurrencyWithoutSymbol loan.sanctionedAmount}}/- ({{words loan.sanctionedAmount}} Only)</strong> granted By Fintree Finance Pvt Ltd to us, I/We, <strong>{{borrower.fullName}}</strong>, residing at <strong>{{#if borrower.address.formatted}}{{borrower.address.formatted}}{{else}}{{borrower.addressFormatted}}{{/if}}</strong> hereby undertake, agree and confirm:</p>
    <p>1. The facility of Rs. {{formatCurrencyWithoutSymbol loan.sanctionedAmount}}/- has been granted to us by Fintree Finance Pvt Ltd under the loan agreement dated {{application.applicationDateFormatted}}.</p>
    <p>2. We shall use the funds received by us from FINTREE FINANCE PRIVATE LIMITED under the aforesaid Loan Agreement for the declared purpose and shall submit all evidence regarding usage of funds.</p>
    <p>3. We undertake, agree and affirm that we will use the funds received for lawful purposes only and not for any speculative or unlawful activities.</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px; text-align: right;">
      <strong>{{borrower.fullName}}</strong><br />
      Borrower Signature
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <!-- 8. CONSENT AND SELF DECLARATION                              -->
  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <div class="page-break"></div>
  <p class="section-title">CONSENT AND SELF DECLARATION</p>
  <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{application.applicationDateFormatted}}</p>
  <p class="numbered">1. I/We hereby declare that all the particulars, information and details provided by me/us are true, correct, complete and up-to-date in all respects.</p>
  <p class="numbered">2. I/We hereby confirm that no insolvency proceedings or suits for recovery of outstanding dues or criminal proceedings have been initiated against me/us.</p>
  <p class="numbered">3. I/We hereby authorise Fintree Finance Private Limited (FFPL) to verify, exchange, share with credit bureaus (CIBIL, etc.) or regulatory authorities regarding my/our loan details.</p>
  <p class="numbered">4. I/We authorise Lender's employees/agents to access premises during normal office hours for verification/investigation.</p>
  <p class="numbered">5. I/We authorise Lender to approach existing bankers or prospective lenders for relevant information.</p>
  <p class="numbered">6. I/We hereby provide consent to receive information/services for service and transaction purposes via telephone/mobile/SMS/Email/WhatsApp.</p>
  <p class="numbered">7. I/We provide consent to Lender to get me registered on CKYC portal if not already registered.</p>
  <div class="avoid-break" style="margin-top: 20px; text-align: right;">
    <p>Yours Faithfully,</p>
    <strong>{{borrower.fullName}}</strong>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <!-- 9. ELECTRONIC ACCEPTANCE CERTIFICATE                         -->
  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <div class="page-break"></div>
  <div class="cert-box">
    <p style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2px;">ELECTRONIC ACCEPTANCE CERTIFICATE</p>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #555; margin-bottom: 6px;">Evidence of electronic acceptance under the Information Technology Act, 2000</p>
    
    <table class="cert-table">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 40%;"><strong>Loan Account Number (LAN)</strong></td>
        <td>{{application.loanAccountNumber}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Borrower Full Name</strong></td>
        <td>{{borrower.fullName}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Verified Mobile Number</strong></td>
        <td>{{borrower.maskedMobile}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Borrower PAN / Aadhaar</strong></td>
        <td>PAN: {{borrower.panMasked}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Sanctioned Loan Amount</strong></td>
        <td>{{formatCurrency loan.sanctionedAmount}} ({{words loan.sanctionedAmount}})</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Accepted Repayment Amount</strong></td>
        <td>{{formatCurrency loan.totalRepaymentAmount}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Tenure / Rate of Interest</strong></td>
        <td>{{loan.tenureFormatted}} / {{pricing.annualInterestRateFormatted}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Electronic Acceptance Status</strong></td>
        <td style="font-weight: bold; color: green;">{{#if electronicAcceptance.completed}}ACCEPTED{{else}}PENDING ACCEPTANCE{{/if}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Acceptance Timestamp</strong></td>
        <td>{{#if electronicAcceptance.acceptedAtFormatted}}{{electronicAcceptance.acceptedAtFormatted}}{{else}}{{document.generatedDateFormatted}}{{/if}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Authentication Session ID</strong></td>
        <td>{{#if electronicAcceptance.transactionReference}}{{electronicAcceptance.transactionReference}}{{else}}N/A{{/if}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Signer IP Address</strong></td>
        <td>{{#if electronicAcceptance.ipAddress}}{{electronicAcceptance.ipAddress}}{{else}}N/A{{/if}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Signer User Agent</strong></td>
        <td>Authenticated Web Session</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Document SHA-256 Hash</strong></td>
        <td style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 6.8pt;">{{#if electronicAcceptance.originalDocumentHash}}{{electronicAcceptance.originalDocumentHash}}{{else}}GENERATED_UPON_SIGNING{{/if}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Lender / Entity</strong></td>
        <td>{{lender.legalName}}</td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <p style="font-size: 7.2pt; margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.25;"><strong>CONSENT STATEMENT:</strong> I confirm that I have read and understood the Personal Loan Agreement. I consent to execute and accept this agreement electronically using the OTP sent to my verified mobile number. I acknowledge that my authenticated session, document hash, timestamp, IP address and device information will be recorded as evidence of this acceptance.</p>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 15px; padding: 0 5px;">
      <div>
        <img src="{{lender.authorizedSignatory.imageUrl}}" alt="Signatory" style="height: 32px;" /><br />
        <strong>For Fintree Finance Private Limited</strong><br />
        <span style="font-size: 7pt;">Authorized Signatory</span>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <strong>{{borrower.fullName}}</strong><br />
        <span style="font-size: 7pt;">Borrower Signature</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
